<style>
    @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
    .page {
        width: 794px; height: 1123px;
        padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
        overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
        position: relative;
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
    h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 0; }
    .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .logo-area { text-align: left; }
    .contact-info { text-align: right; font-size: 11pt; }
    .form-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .form-row > div { flex: 1; }
    .radio-group { margin-top: 10px; }
    .signature-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 60px; padding-top: 5px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-info">
        <div class="logo-area">
            <!-- Placeholder for Logo -->
            <img src="" alt="Logo" style="height: 80px; vertical-align: middle;">
            <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 10px;">University of the Incarnate Word</h1>
            <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">Office of Financial Assistance</h2>
            <h3 style="font-size: 12pt;">State Aid Eligibility Certification</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-info">
            <p>4301 Broadway, Box {{ contact_info.box_number }}</p>
            <p>San Antonio, TX {{ contact_info.zip_code }}</p>
            <p>Phone: (210) {{ contact_info.phone_number }}</p>
            <p>Fax: (210) {{ contact_info.fax_number }}</p>
            <p><a href="mailto:{{ contact_info.email }}">{{ contact_info.email }}</a></p>
            <p>www.uiw.edu/financial</p>
            <p>Revised {{ revision_date }}</p>
            <p>STCERT</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
        <p>In accordance with Texas Family Code, Title 5, Section 231.006, a student who is obligated to pay child support and is more than 30 days delinquent is not eligible to receive a state-funded grant or loan.</p>
        <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">Statement of Eligibility</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>Student Name: <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
            <div>Date of Birth: <span data-field="date_of_birth">{{ date_of_birth }}</span></div>
            <div>UIW ID Number: <span data-field="uiw_id_number">{{ uiw_id_number }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <p>Please mark your status below:</p>
        <div class="radio-group">
            <label>
                <input type="radio" name="status" value="not_obligated"> I am NOT obligated to pay child support
            </label><br>
            <label>
                <input type="radio" name="status" value="obligated"> I AM obligated to pay child support; and
            </label><br>
            <label>
                <input type="radio" name="status" value="not_delinquent"> I AM NOT more than 30 days delinquent; OR
            </label><br>
            <label>
                <input type="radio" name="status" value="delinquent"> I AM more than 30 days delinquent.
            </label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
        <h2 style="text-align: center;">Certification Statement</h2>
        <p>I certify the information above is true and accurate. In accordance with <span data-field="code_reference">{{ code_reference }}</span>, Texas Family Code, I acknowledge that this grant or loan may be terminated and payment may be withheld if this certification is inaccurate.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-line">
        <div>Student Signature _________________________</div>
        <div>Date _________________________</div>
    </div>
</div>